[0.1.1]
* Security update: move to the digest-pinned Cloudron base image 6.0.1 with its patched CA bundle and shared MIME data. LibreCrawl stays at commit 05a1372.

[0.1.0]
* Initial Cloudron package for LibreCrawl commit 05a1372.
* Signed-in-only access with operator-managed accounts and persistent sessions.
* Persistent SQLite data, upgrade snapshots and daily finished-crawl retention.
* Chromium rendering available, disabled by default; 2 GiB default memory.
